    }
  ],
  "candidate": {
    "status": "answered",
    "answer": "Delta Field Supply does not have a minimum order subtotal requirement. The procurement assistant handles a request that includes items from multiple suppliers by processing them as separate orders; one supplier's subtotal cannot satisfy another supplier's minimum order requirement. This is explicitly stated in the Estuary Instruments supplier conditions, which note that 'a mixed-supplier request is handled as separate orders; one supplier's subtotal cannot satisfy another supplier's minimum.'",
